<title>JAPAN: Toyota says to resume near-normal output Friday.</title>
<headline>Toyota says to resume near-normal output Friday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Toyota Motor Corp expects to resume near-normal levels of output at all domestic production lines on Friday, a Toyota spokesman told Reuters on Tuesday.</p>
